Data files vendored in this repository:

* `src/infrastructure/persistence/gbk_table.bin` — GBK double-byte
  encoding table, generated from public Unicode/WHATWG encoding indexes.
* `src/infrastructure/persistence/gb18030_ranges.bin` — GB18030 four-byte
  linear mapping table, generated from the WHATWG Encoding Standard's
  `index-gb18030-ranges` table (public domain specification data).
* `src/infrastructure/spell/words.txt` — English word list vendored for
  the spell checker (project-specific compilation of common words).
